mode: "100644"
text: "---\ndescription: \"End-to-end AGYOS video production workflow across Google Flow, Chopify, ai-video-editor, faceless-shorts, Manim, FFmpeg EDL rendering, AI repair, and organic film finishing\"\nargument-hint: \"<video goal, source path, or URL>\"\n---\n\n# AGYOS Unified Video Production Workflow\n\nCoordinates video generation, headless clipping, talking-head editing, code-rendered shorts, mathematical animations, defect repair, organic film finishing, and post-render verification.\n\n## Sequence\n\n```\n[1. Route & Intake] -> [2. Script / Transcript] -> [3. Generate / Clip / Edit] -> [4. Repair & De-AI] -> [5. Self-Eval Gate]\n```\n\n### Phase 1: Route & Intake\n\n- Run `bin/agyos video route \"<goal>\" --json` to inspect local capabilities and select the optimal pipeline.\n- Probe every input media file with `ffprobe` (resolution, fps, duration, audio channels).\n- Confirm strategy, aspect ratio (`9:16`, `16:9`, `1:1`), and credit-spending actions with the user before execution.\n\n### Phase 2: Script, Storyboard, or Packed Transcript\n\n- **From scratch (vertical)**: `bin/agyos video script \"<topic>\" --json` and `bin/agyos video audit <script.md>`.\n- **From scratch (Veo 3.1 / Flow)**: `bin/agyos video veo-prompt \"<idea>\" --ratio 9:16 --duration 8 --json`.\n- **From existing footage**: Transcribe verbatim at word level and pack into phrase markdown via `bin/agyos video pack-transcript transcript.json --out takes_packed.md`.\n\n### Phase 3: Generate, Clip, or Assemble\n\n- **Google Flow / Veo 3.1**: Dry-run (`auto_confirm: false`) -> inspect screenshot -> generate (`auto_confirm: true`) -> Scene Builder 7s hops (`flow_scene_add` -> `flow_scene_extend`).\n- **Chopify Headless Clipping**: `./bin/chopify preflight` -> `project create` -> `project prepare` -> `project get` -> `project render`.\n- **EDL Assembly (12 Hard Rules)**: `bin/agyos video edl-validate edl.json --check-files` -> `edl-remap-srt` -> `edl-render edl.json -o preview.mp4 --preview`.\n- **Faceless Shorts / Manim**: `tools/video/faceless-shorts/scripts/new_video.sh` or `bin/agyos video manim <scene.py>`.\n\n### Phase 4: Repair & Organic Film Finishing\n\n- Remove Flow corner watermark: `uv run scripts/remove_flow_watermark.py raw.mp4 delogo.mp4`.\n- Run structural repair BEFORE grain/halation: `uv run scripts/repair_ai_video.py full delogo.mp4 -o repaired.mp4`.\n- Apply organic cinema finish: `uv run scripts/organic_film_engine.py master repaired.mp4 -o final.mp4 --profile cinema-2383`.\n\n### Phase 5: Post-Render Self-Eval Gate\n\n- Run `bin/agyos video self-eval final.mp4 --edl edl.json --json` (`ffprobe`, `ebur128` -14 LUFS / -1.0 dBTP, `blackdetect`).\n- Generate cut-boundary filmstrips via `bin/agyos video timeline-view final.mp4 <t-1.5> <t+1.5> -o cut_check.png`.\n- Iterate up to 3 passes until all checks pass before presenting the final output.\n"
